'
' course-management.activity.puml
' ───────────────────────────────
' AGL behavioral input — companion to course-management.puml.
' Auto-detected by PlantUmlParser (same base name + `.activity.puml`) or passed
' explicitly with `-a course-management.activity.puml`.
'
' Demonstrates the AGL Structured Atomic Action (SAA) sequence
'   open → newObject → setDataFieldValues → createObject
' for the two <<UseCase>> classes already declared in course-management.puml,
' plus a Decision node modeling Student.helpRequested (AGL "DHelpOrSClass" pattern
' referenced in EnrollmentService's comment).
'
@startuml CourseManagement-Activity

start

|RegisterStudentUseCase|
:open;
:newObject(Student);
:setDataFieldValues(name, email);
:createObject(Student) <<Created>>;

|EnrollStudentUseCase|
:open;
:newObject(Enrolment);
:setDataFieldValues(studentId, courseModuleId);
:createObject(Enrolment) <<Created>>;

|Student|
if (helpRequested?) then (yes)
  :requestHelp;
else (no)
endif

stop

@enduml
